# Ice Floe targets a tapped ground attacker but not a flyer or a nonattacker; it keeps the attacker tapped until its controller chooses to untap the land.
[Bot1 Deck]
Ice Floe
Island x20
[Bot2 Deck]
Forest
Llanowar Elves
Ornithopter
Memnite
Island x20
[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Ice Floe.Play
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Llanowar Elves.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Memnite.Cast
[T4 Bot2.DeclareAttackers]
Bot2.Attack(Llanowar Elves > Bot1; Ornithopter > Bot1)
! Bot1.Battlefield.Ice Floe.Activate(Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
! Bot1.Battlefield.Ice Floe.Activate(Bot2.Battlefield.Memnite)
Bot1.Battlefield.Ice Floe.Activate(Bot2.Battlefield.Llanowar Elves)
? Bot1.Battlefield.Ice Floe.Tapped = true
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T4 Bot2.Main2]
? Bot1.Life = 19
Bot1.Decline
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
? Bot1.Battlefield.Ice Floe.Tapped = true
[T6 Bot2.Main1]
? Bot2.Battlefield.Llanowar Elves.Tapped = true
Bot1.Accept
[T7 Bot1.Main1]
? Bot1.Battlefield.Ice Floe.Tapped = false
? Bot2.Battlefield.Llanowar Elves.Tapped = true
[T8 Bot2.Main1]
[Expect]
Bot2.Battlefield.Llanowar Elves.Tapped = false
